{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Authenticate cross-execution reference frames.** Two-sided opt-in prevents accidental incompatibility but does not prove the claimed producer context, reference, or tenant; a forged or leaked frame could load another execution's payload from shared storage. Require a signed/MACed capability or service-attested source plus tenant validation, with forged-reference and cross-tenant rejection tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ppydU","finding_digest":"07c17891beaef2cdce8b082fed3ec52e153ba1790902b74f69a2cbd49d8b5cf0","finding_id":"arf_v1_a7axren6v3zm3tulbax62pwffy","finding_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::chained-invoke-envelope::producer-authentication","identity_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::chained-invoke-envelope::producer-authentication","line":573,"observation_digest":"055390bb80c7bea63ce53493d7ebeed1dc8d145f13c0221710803e1e5d28b179","observation_id":"aro_v1_avjzbo4ay67kmphfgsj5p27o2h","path":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_a7axren6v3zm3tulbax62pwffy","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:53:52Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3akhipwlxgh53mzfcxrph3hpjl","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"4d751be9025f5188d73fa525dd0e72105d864f40","reviewer":"codex","start_line":571,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":678},"record_id":"art_v1_6axlw2mddostw4n5uxh4szuguq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:53:52Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
